{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25487","headline":"思在山居日偶成此咏邀松阳子同作 · 李德裕","name":"思在山居日偶成此咏邀松阳子同作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲思昔岁事，忽忽念伊川。\n乘月步秋坂，满山闻石泉。\n回塘碧潭映，高树绿萝悬。\n露下呌田鹤，风来嘶晚蝉。\n怀兹长在梦，归去且无缘。\n幽谷人未至，兰苕应更鲜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25487.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25487","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}